762.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"### What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\nImplements proposal closes godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6798\r\nFix #118723\r\n\r\n### What is the rationale for the approach used in this PR?\r\nTwo new parameters have been added to item_list.h: horizontal_navigation_wraparound and vertical_navigation_wraparound.\r\nThe corresponding enum is NavigationWraparound.\r\n\r\nWith NavigationWraparound NEXT keyboard navigation continues into the adjacent row or column.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/026b226e-bb84-43a8-bb43-f7adea29423d\r\n\r\nWith NavigationWraparound SAME keyboard navigation wraps to the opposite end of the same row or column.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cf05f0da-ec90-4304-8add-4278c6397548\r\n\r\nAnd with NavigationWraparound NONE its just stops at the boundary of the row or column.\r\n\r\nThe code also correctly identifies items that aren't selecteble and skips over them. (as shown in the videos)\r\n\r\n### Was generative AI (LLM AI) used to create a portion of this PR?\r\nI used Claude Opus 4.7 to navigate the code and flag potential issues and inconsistencies in final result. All changes were made manually by me.\r\n\r\n### Are there any parts of this PR that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers?\r\nI have no idea how to write documentation properly. I just did the best I could.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118762/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118762/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}